    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Superno is a casual  first person shooter with a heavy focus on movement, placeable structures and character specific abilities. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong>Play through a linear story campaign alone or with friends as various cool, fun (and sometimes slightly dumb) characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight other players in online party modes such as King of the hill, Hide and seek, Free for all Deathmatch, Coin Runner and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or team up with friends in randomly generated Arena Missions where you are tasked with completing 3 objectives as enemies come swarming from all sides.<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2789860/extras/94d1619cb112e3f5892369fbd2d3b8e6.avif?t=1738681113\" width=460 height=214 /></span><strong></strong></p>",
